### ==========================================
### 5: DESATIVAR (PUT com isActive:false)
### ==========================================
# O PUT só aceita { "isActive": false } - não renomeia nem altera entradas.

### 5. PUT Body vazio (400 Bad Request)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/forecasts/{{forecastId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
?? status == 400

### 5.1 PUT Só com name (400 Bad Request - não é possível renomear)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/forecasts/{{forecastId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Outro_Nome"
}
?? status == 400

### 5.2 PUT isActive:true (400 Bad Request)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/forecasts/{{forecastId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}
?? status == 400

